    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24028" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in-sūdo</span></b> , āvi,
			ātum, 1, v. n., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to sweat in</i>, <i>on</i>, or <i>at</i> any thing (<b>poet.</b> and post-Aug.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quīs (libellis) manus insudet vulgi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor.
					S. 1, 4, 72</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">labori,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Calp.
					Ecl. 5, 10</span></i>
			.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> In
			gen., <i>to sweat</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">si corpus dormientis insudat,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cels.
					1, 4, 6</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">2, 2</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
